          "disks": "Disks to report throughput, busy % and latency for.",
          "interfaces": "Interfaces to report traffic for. Leave empty for none.",
          "scan_interval": "Rates are averaged over the whole interval, so a longer interval only lowers resolution and means fewer recorder writes."
        }
      }
    },
